msgid "Statistics Panel Screen"
msgstr "统计面板屏幕"

msgid "Settings for the minimal statistics panel (xwrt-panel) of the GL-BE10000 / GL-BE14000. The panel shows WAN usage, system state, clients with their rate, port links, WAN interfaces and WiFi status. Changes are applied to /etc/config/xwrt_panel and the panel service is restarted on \"Save & Apply\"."
msgstr "GL-BE10000 / GL-BE14000 极简统计面板（xwrt-panel）设置。面板显示 WAN 用量、系统状态、客户端速率、网口链路、多 WAN 与 WiFi 状态。修改写入 /etc/config/xwrt_panel，点击「保存并应用」后面板服务会重启。"

msgid "Panel service"
msgstr "面板服务"

msgid "Service state"
msgstr "服务状态"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

msgid "Restart panel"
msgstr "重启面板"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Service action \"%s\" %s"
msgstr "服务操作「%s」%s"

msgid "succeeded"
msgstr "成功"

msgid "failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgid "Display"
msgstr "显示"

msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "亮度"

msgid "Panel backlight brightness, 10 to 100 percent."
msgstr "面板背光亮度，10 到 100%。"

msgid "Boot logo (s)"
msgstr "启动 logo（秒）"

msgid "Seconds the x-wrt mark stays on the panel while the service starts up. A touch clears it right away. Set to 0 to skip the splash."
msgstr "面板启动时 x-wrt 标记停留的秒数，触摸会立即清除。设为 0 则不显示启动画面。"

msgid "Page rotation (s)"
msgstr "自动翻页（秒）"

msgid "Automatically switch to the next page every N seconds. Set to 0 to only change pages by swiping."
msgstr "每隔 N 秒自动切换到下一页。设为 0 则只能通过滑动翻页。"

msgid "Blank after (min)"
msgstr "息屏时间（分钟）"

msgid "Minutes without touch before the backlight turns off. Set to 0 to keep the screen always on. Any touch wakes the panel."
msgstr "无触摸操作多少分钟后关闭背光。设为 0 则屏幕常亮。任意触摸可唤醒面板。"

msgid "Pages"
msgstr "页面"

msgid "At least one page must stay enabled."
msgstr "至少保留一个页面。"

msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用量"

msgid "WAN up/down rates, totals and a scrolling rate graph."
msgstr "WAN 上下行速率、累计总量与滚动速率图。"

msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

msgid "CPU load, memory, SoC temperature, fan speed and uptime."
msgstr "CPU 负载、内存占用、SoC 温度、风扇转速与运行时长。"

msgid "Clients"
msgstr "客户端"

msgid "DHCP leases and snooped clients, with the per-client rate reported by natflow."
msgstr "DHCP 租约与侦测到的客户端，并显示 natflow 上报的每客户端速率。"

msgid "Ports"
msgstr "网口"

msgid "Link state and negotiated speed of every wan/lan/sfp port, with its current rate."
msgstr "每个 wan/lan/sfp 口的链路状态、协商速率与当前速率。"

msgid "WAN"
msgstr "多 WAN"

msgid "Every WAN interface with its protocol, address and uptime. Handy with mwan3 or several uplinks."
msgstr "每个 WAN 接口的协议、地址与在线时长。多拨或 mwan3 场景下很实用。"

msgid "WiFi"
msgstr "WiFi"

msgid "Wireless networks with band, encryption and station count."
msgstr "无线网络列表，含频段、加密方式与已连接终端数。"
